               class CustomerModel:
                   id: int
                   name: str
       
           On a base class::
       
               @dataclass_transform()
               class ModelBase: ...
       
               class CustomerModel(ModelBase):
                   id: int
                   name: str
       
           On a metaclass::
       
               @dataclass_transform()
               class ModelMeta(type): ...
       
               class ModelBase(metaclass=ModelMeta): ...
       
